    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under Sub-sections (1) and (2) of the Section 22A of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter235) as amended by Act, No. 83 of 1988, I, Mangala Samaraweera, Minister of Finance of Democratic Socialist Republicof Sri Lanka, do by this Notification amend the Rule No. 4 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1053/11 of 11.11.1998by insertion of the following new section immediately after the Section 4 of the Gazette.",
